    "message": "v0.99.35: correct author metadata; add CITATION and packaging hygiene\n\nAuthor identity correction (DESCRIPTION Authors@R):\n- Replace ORCID 0000-0002-1825-0097 (ORCID's fictional demo account\n  Josiah Carberry) with the author's real ORCID 0000-0002-2616-5132\n- Use real name Shenhui Xu (aut + cre, unchanged email) instead of the\n  placeholder \"Dudali Lab\" persona, per Bioconductor guidance that the\n  maintainer be an identifiable individual\n- Add contributor and reviewer credits:\n  Yuanhang Zhao (ctb, zy0928hang@163.com)\n  Mireia Ramos-Rodriguez (rev, Bioconductor reviewer of the initial\n  submission, https://github.com/mireia-bioinfo)\n\nSynchronized identity across all tracked files:\n- LICENSE stub COPYRIGHT HOLDER and LICENSE.md copyright line\n- Package-level man page @author (roxygen + Rd)\n- YAML author field in all four vignettes (EN + ZH)\n\nPackaging hygiene:\n- Add inst/CITATION so citation(\"GSEAlens\") resolves correctly; the\n  version string is derived from meta$Version at render time\n- .Rbuildignore: exclude ^\\.pi-subagents$ (local session artifacts\n  that previously leaked into the tarball causing a hidden-files NOTE)\n  and *.tar.gz build products\n\nVerified: R CMD check --no-manual (with vignettes) Status: OK\n(0 ERROR / 0 WARNING / 0 NOTE); BiocCheck 0 ERRORS / 0 WARNINGS;\nCITATION parsing and non-ASCII name rendering checked.\n",
    "time": 1787112736
